<p>Qaid me sakina ne shaah ko pukaara hai<br />
Dekhiye sitam kya ho zulm aashkaara hai</p>

<p>Dhoond ne kaha'n jaau'n, apne pyaare ammu ko<br />
Kis taraf ko hai darya , kis taraf kanaara hai</p>

<p>Margaye hai sab mere, karbala ke maidaa'n me <br />
Aisa lut gaya kunba , koi na hamaara hai</p>

<p>Kya kahu'n mai jo guzri, raahe shaam me baba<br />
Kaan mere zaqmi hai, kurta paara paara hai</p>

<p>
Meri laash ko bhayya, qaake tar me dafnaana<br />
mar rahi hu'n mai pyaasi, pyaas hi ne maara hai</p>

<p>Ghul hai aaj zindaa'n me, mar gayi sakina jaa'n<br />
dafn kaise ho mayyat, bhai be sahaara hai<br />
